    <body stage="SubtitleEdit">
        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="1">
                <start-time>00:00:01,645</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:06,325</end-time>
                <translation>1960年 一名前纳粹军官
1960年一人の元ナチス将校が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="2">
                <start-time>00:00:06,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:09,075</end-time>
                <translation>被以色列情报部门逮捕</translation>
                <original>イスラエル諜報部によって拘束され</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="3">
                <start-time>00:00:09,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:13,175</end-time>
                <translation>在耶路撒冷接受审判</translation>
                <original>エルサレムで裁判にかけられます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="4">
                <start-time>00:00:13,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:16,400</end-time>
                <translation>此人名叫阿道夫·艾希曼</translation>
                <original>男の名はアドルフアイヒマン</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="5">
                <start-time>00:00:16,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:20,425</end-time>
                <translation>是负责将犹太人送入灭绝营的总负责人</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人を絶滅収容所に総する責任者でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="6">
                <start-time>00:00:22,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:25,400</end-time>
                <translation>政治哲学家汉娜·阿伦特</translation>
                <original>政治哲学者ハンナ·アーレントは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="7">
                <start-time>00:00:25,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:29,150</end-time>
                <translation>主动申请旁听这场审判
自ら志願してこの裁判を傍聴</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="8">
                <start-time>00:00:29,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:32,600</end-time>
                <translation>与数百万人的死亡有关的 艾希曼</translation>
                <original>何100万人もの死に関わったアイヒマンが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="9">
                <start-time>00:00:32,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:35,820</end-time>
                <translation>却是一个随处可见的平凡之人</translation>
                <original>どこにでもいる平凡な人間だったことに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="10">
                <start-time>00:00:35,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:37,100</end-time>
                <translation>这令她深受冲击</translation>
                <original>衝撃を受けます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="11">
                <start-time>00:00:38,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:42,075</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著 本回将从阿伦特的著作出发</translation>
                <original>100分de名著アーレントの著作から</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="12">
                <start-time>00:00:42,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:47,420</end-time>
                <translation>探究普通人是如何变成恶人的</translation>
                <original>普通の人間がいかにして悪になるのか その真相に迫ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="13">
                <start-time>00:01:09,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:14,475</end-time>
                <translation>第4回 平庸之恶
第4回　悪は陳腐である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="14">
                <start-time>00:01:15,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:18,157</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著 主持人岛津有理子
100分de名著　司会の島津有理子です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="15">
                <start-time>00:01:18,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:19,875</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="16">
                <start-time>00:01:19,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:25,675</end-time>
                <translation>到上一回为止 我们阅读了汉娜·阿伦特共三卷的《极权主义的起源》</translation>
                <original>前回まで三巻からなる ハンナ・アレントの全体主義の起源について見てきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="17">
                <start-time>00:01:25,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:28,125</end-time>
                <translation>主题相当沉重 感觉如何？</translation>
                <original>まあ重いテーマでしたけどいかがでしたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="18">
                <start-time>00:01:28,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:33,900</end-time>
                <translation>那些看似没有直接重大关联的事件</translation>
                <original>それほど直接的にはええ大きく関係なさそうな出来事が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="19">
                <start-time>00:01:33,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,775</end-time>
                <translation>大量交织在一起</translation>
                <original>いっぱい絡み合って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="20">
                <start-time>00:01:35,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,750</end-time>
                <translation>最终如何导致了对犹太人的大屠杀</translation>
                <original>結果そのユダヤ人の大虐殺に至るまでを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="21">
                <start-time>00:01:39,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:42,075</end-time>
                <translation>多亏了老师通俗易懂的解读</translation>
                <original>わかりやすく読み解いてもらったおかげで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="22">
                <start-time>00:01:42,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:45,600</end-time>
                <translation>我虽然理解了 但正因理解了才觉得有些可怕</translation>
                <original>理解できたんですけど理解できた分ちょっと怖くて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="23">
                <start-time>00:01:45,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:48,350</end-time>
                <translation>所以这最后一回我也是带着忐忑的心情来面对的</translation>
                <original>なんかこの最終やもビビりながら臨んでます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="24">
                <start-time>00:01:48,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:50,822</end-time>
                <translation>好的 本回呢</translation>
                <original>はい今回はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="25">
                <start-time>00:01:50,822</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:56,200</end-time>
                <translation>我们来解读阿伦特在《极权主义的起源》之后写下的这本书</translation>
                <original>アーレントが全体主義の起源ののちに書いたこちらの本</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="26">
                <start-time>00:01:56,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:59,575</end-time>
                <translation>《艾希曼在耶路撒冷》</translation>
                <original>『エルサレムのアイヒマン』を読み解いていきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="27">
                <start-time>00:01:59,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:03,125</end-time>
                <translation>指导老师是金泽大学教授仲正昌树先生
指南役は金沢大学教授の仲正昌樹さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="28">
                <start-time>00:02:03,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:05,950</end-time>
                <translation>（齐声说）请多关照</translation>
                <original>（一斉に）よろしくお願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="29">
                <start-time>00:02:05,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:09,875</end-time>
                <translation>仲正老师 这本《耶路撒冷的艾希曼》是一本什么样的书呢？</translation>
                <original>仲間さんこの『エルサレムのアイヒマン』という本はどういったものなんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="30">
                <start-time>00:02:09,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,680</end-time>
                <translation>是呢 在《极权主义的起源》第三卷中</translation>
                <original>そうですねあの全体主義の起源の三巻で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="31">
                <start-time>00:02:13,710</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:17,400</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特论述了纳粹的世界观</translation>
                <original>まあアーレントはそのナチスの世界観</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="32">
                <start-time>00:02:17,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:20,252</end-time>
                <translation>如何使屠杀犹太人成为可能</translation>
                <original>がまあユダヤ人の虐殺を可能にしたという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="33">
                <start-time>00:02:20,252</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:23,700</end-time>
                <translation>那本书是从宏观脉络去说明的“犹太人屠杀”</translation>
                <original>ようなまあ筋で話を展開してきたんですけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="34">
                <start-time>00:02:23,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,758</end-time>
                <translation>那么 实际执行这些的每个德国人</translation>
                <original>じゃあそれを実行した個々のドイツ人は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="35">
                <start-time>00:02:26,758</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:28,493</end-time>
                <translation>他们的那种感觉是如何产生的呢？</translation>
                <original>その感覚どうして生まれてきたのかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="36">
                <start-time>00:02:28,493</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:32,630</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特决定亲眼去看看艾希曼的审判</translation>
                <original>アーレントは絶滅計画の実務責任者あった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="37">
                <start-time>00:02:32,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:36,100</end-time>
                <translation>这个灭绝计划的实际负责人</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンの裁判をまあ自分の目で見ていこうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="38">
                <start-time>00:02:36,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:41,974</end-time>
                <translation>她感到作为犹太幸存者 这仿佛是自己的使命</translation>
                <original>まあそういうことがユダヤ人の生き残りとしてのまあ使命のように感じて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="39">
                <start-time>00:02:41,974</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:45,900</end-time>
                <translation>她那期间的媒体记录就成了这本《耶路撒冷的艾希曼》</translation>
                <original>その記録をこの「エルサレムのアイヒマン」という本にしたわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="40">
                <start-time>00:02:46,870</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:47,880</end-time>
                <translation>那么首先</translation>
                <original>それではまず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="41">
                <start-time>00:02:47,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:49,715</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来看看这位前纳粹军官</translation>
                <original>この元ナチス将校</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="42">
                <start-time>00:02:49,715</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:53,110</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼是一个什么样的人物</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンとはどのような人物だったのかを見て行きましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="43">
                <start-time>00:02:54,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:59,500</end-time>
                <translation>阿道夫·艾希曼与阿伦特同样出生于1906年</translation>
                <original>アドルフ・アイヒマンはアーレントと同じ1906年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="44">
                <start-time>00:02:59,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:02,800</end-time>
                <translation>生于德国一个平凡的中产阶级家庭</translation>
                <original>ドイツの平凡な中産階級の家に生まれます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="45">
                <start-time>00:03:05,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:08,267</end-time>
                <translation>从工业专科学校退学后
工業専門学校を中退したのち</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="46">
                <start-time>00:03:08,267</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:11,225</end-time>
                <translation>辗转做过好几份工作</translation>
                <original>いくつもの職を転々としますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="47">
                <start-time>00:03:11,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:14,105</end-time>
                <translation>（最终在石油公司）因裁员而失业
人員整理のために失業</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="48">
                <start-time>00:03:16,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:19,625</end-time>
                <translation>由于此前已经加入纳粹党</translation>
                <original>既にナチスに入党していたことから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="49">
                <start-time>00:03:19,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:25,375</end-time>
                <translation>他以此为契机志愿加入党卫队内部的情报机构——公安部
これを機に親衛隊内部の諜報機関である公安部に志願</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="50">
                <start-time>00:03:25,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:28,630</end-time>
                <translation>负责与犹太人问题相关的工作</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人問題に関する仕事を担当します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="51">
                <start-time>00:03:32,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:38,340</end-time>
                <translation>并在将犹太人移居德国境外的交涉总工作出色</translation>
                <original>そしてユダヤ人をドイツ国外へ移住させるための交渉に力を振るいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="52">
                <start-time>00:03:42,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:44,125</end-time>
                <translation>熟记复杂的规章制度
複雑な規則を暗記し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="53">
                <start-time>00:03:44,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:47,239</end-time>
                <translation>顺利推进工作的艾希曼</translation>
                <original>順調に仕事を進めていったアイヒマンは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="54">
                <start-time>00:03:47,239</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:53,350</end-time>
                <translation>作为犹太人移居问题的专家得到认可 不断获得晋升</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人移住の専門家として認められ昇進を重ねます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="55">
                <start-time>00:03:53,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:58,125</end-time>
                <translation>他并非对反犹主义抱有使命感</translation>
                <original>彼は反ユダヤ主義に使命感を感じていたわけでもなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="56">
                <start-time>00:03:58,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:01,125</end-time>
                <translation>甚至没有读过希特勒的《我的奋斗》</translation>
                <original>ヒトラーの『我が闘争』も読んだことのない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="57">
                <start-time>00:04:01,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:03,670</end-time>
                <translation>只是一个官僚而已</translation>
                <original>ただの役人だったのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="58">
                <start-time>00:04:06,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:08,925</end-time>
                <translation>第二次世界大战爆发后
第2次世界大戦がはじまると</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="59">
                <start-time>00:04:08,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:14,780</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼成为新设立的国家保安总局犹太人科的科长</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは新設された国家保安本部のユダヤ人か課長となります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="60">
                <start-time>00:04:17,290</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:19,150</end-time>
                <translation>在此期间 纳粹</translation>
                <original>そんな中ナチスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="61">
                <start-time>00:04:19,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:23,125</end-time>
                <translation>决定了犹太人问题的最终解决方案
ユダヤ人問題の最終解決を決定</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="62">
                <start-time>00:04:23,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:28,475</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼虽然知道灭绝营里正在发生什么</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは絶滅収容所で何が行われているかを知りながらも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="63">
                <start-time>00:04:28,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:31,425</end-time>
                <translation>但仍作为犹太人移送工作的实际负责人
ユダヤ人移送の実務責任者として</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="64">
                <start-time>00:04:31,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:34,060</end-time>
                <translation>他彻底履行了自己的职务</translation>
                <original>その職務を全うしてゆくのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="65">
                <start-time>00:04:36,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:40,925</end-time>
                <translation>纳粹投降后 艾希曼使用假名逃亡</translation>
                <original>ナチス降伏後アイヒマンは偽名を使って逃亡</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="66">
                <start-time>00:04:40,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:45,030</end-time>
                <translation>在阿根廷与家人过着不引人注目的生活</translation>
                <original>アルゼンチンで家族とともに目立たない生活を送ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="67">
                <start-time>00:04:46,110</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:48,500</end-time>
                <translation>然而在1960年</translation>
                <original>しかし1960年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="68">
                <start-time>00:04:48,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:52,525</end-time>
                <translation>他的真实身份被以色列情报机构发现</translation>
                <original>イスラエル諜報部によって正体が発覚</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="69">
                <start-time>00:04:52,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:55,800</end-time>
                <translation>被秘密拘捕并押送至耶路撒冷</translation>
                <original>密かに拘束されエルサレムに連行されます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="70">
                <start-time>00:04:58,605</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:01,725</end-time>
                <translation>次年4月开庭审理
翌年4月公判開始</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="71">
                <start-time>00:05:01,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:04,975</end-time>
                <translation>法官和检察官都是以色列国民
裁判官も検事もイスラエル国民</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="72">
                <start-time>00:05:04,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:07,770</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 这是一个由犹太人组成的法庭</translation>
                <original>すなわちユダヤ人という法廷でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="73">
                <start-time>00:05:10,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:12,975</end-time>
                <translation>在防弹玻璃罩中</translation>
                <original>防弾ガラスのケースの中</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="74">
                <start-time>00:05:12,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:17,580</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼平静地陈述了自己做过的事情</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは自分が何をなしたのかを淡々と証言します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="75">
                <start-time>00:05:18,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:21,425</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特旁听了审判</translation>
                <original>アーレントは裁判を傍聴し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="76">
                <start-time>00:05:21,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:24,190</end-time>
                <translation>倾听了艾希曼的主张</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンの主張に耳を傾けました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="77">
                <start-time>00:05:28,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:30,650</end-time>
                <translation>他所做的一切</translation>
                <original>彼のすることはすべて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="78">
                <start-time>00:05:30,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:33,475</end-time>
                <translation>按照他自己的看法
彼自身の見方によれば</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="79">
                <start-time>00:05:33,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:37,525</end-time>
                <translation>都是作为一个守法公民所做的</translation>
                <original>子を守る市民として行っていることだった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="80">
                <start-time>00:05:37,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:42,725</end-time>
                <translation>正如他本人在警察局和法庭上反复所说的那样</translation>
                <original>彼自身警察でも法廷でも繰り返し言っているように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="81">
                <start-time>00:05:42,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:46,700</end-time>
                <translation>他履行了自己的义务
彼は自分の義務を行った</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="82">
                <start-time>00:05:46,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:49,350</end-time>
                <translation>他不仅仅是遵守命令</translation>
                <original>命令に従っただけではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="83">
                <start-time>00:05:49,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:52,600</end-time>
                <translation>同时也是在遵守法律</translation>
                <original>法にもしたがっていたのだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="84">
                <start-time>00:05:52,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:57,875</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼曾多次透露这是一个重要的区别</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンはこれは重要な相違であると色々ほのめかしたが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="85">
                <start-time>00:05:57,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:02,655</end-time>
                <translation>但辩方和法官都没有采纳这种说法</translation>
                <original>弁護側も判事もそうした言い分は取り上げなかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="86">
                <start-time>00:06:04,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:08,025</end-time>
                <translation>从犹太人的角度来看 这个人确实可恨</translation>
                <original>まあユダヤ人からすればにっくき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="87">
                <start-time>00:06:08,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:09,970</end-time>
                <translation>会忍不住想 如果没有这个人就好了</translation>
                <original>この人がいなければと思っちゃいますもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="88">
                <start-time>00:06:09,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:16,021</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 阿伦特的记述都相当客观</translation>
                <original>ですねアーレントの記述というのはかなりまぁあの 客観的なもので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="89">
                <start-time>00:06:16,021</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:21,460</end-time>
                <translation>这场审判并非真正意义上基于近代法的审判</translation>
                <original>この裁判というのが本当の意味でその近代法に基づいた裁判ではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="90">
                <start-time>00:06:21,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:25,230</end-time>
                <translation>而是带有“政治秀”色彩的审判</translation>
                <original>「政治ショー」のようなあの色彩思っていたんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="91">
                <start-time>00:06:25,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:30,290</end-time>
                <translation>她是在将这一点入视野的基础上</translation>
                <original>そういうところもちゃんとこうあの視野に入れながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="92">
                <start-time>00:06:30,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:33,050</end-time>
                <translation>来记述这场艾希曼审判的</translation>
                <original>このアイヒマン裁判というのを記述しているわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="93">
                <start-time>00:06:33,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:35,600</end-time>
                <translation>观察他后 我们能清楚地了解到</translation>
                <original>彼を見ているとどうもやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="94">
                <start-time>00:06:35,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:39,900</end-time>
                <translation>他是一名能干的官僚</translation>
                <original>有能な官僚であるとそれがはっきり分かるわけ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="95">
                <start-time>00:06:39,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:42,760</end-time>
                <translation>而他将那种能干的官僚做派</translation>
                <original>でそれをその有能な官僚ぶりを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="96">
                <start-time>00:06:42,790</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:45,350</end-time>
                <translation>在审判场上也一直维持着</translation>
                <original>あの裁判の場でも維持しているわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="97">
                <start-time>00:06:45,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:48,453</end-time>
                <translation>从客观情况来看</translation>
                <original>でこれもう客観的な状況からして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="98">
                <start-time>00:06:48,453</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:50,175</end-time>
                <translation>他对自己必须被判处死刑这件事</translation>
                <original>自分はもう死刑にされないといけないということ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="99">
                <start-time>00:06:50,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:52,825</end-time>
                <translation>我想他无论如何也是明白的</translation>
                <original>いくらなんでもわかってると思う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="100">
                <start-time>00:06:52,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:56,600</end-time>
                <translation>但他还是将那种能干的官僚做派</translation>
                <original>でもやっぱりその有能な官僚ぶりを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="101">
                <start-time>00:06:56,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:01,625</end-time>
                <translation>贯穿于他明知是政治秀这个审判场上</translation>
                <original>その政治ショーであるとわかっている裁判の場で貫いてるは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="102">
                <start-time>00:07:01,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:07,025</end-time>
                <translation>即使让他作证 也看不出多少恶魔般的特质</translation>
                <original>彼に証言させても悪の権化的なところがあんまり出てこないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="103">
                <start-time>00:07:07,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:11,500</end-time>
                <translation>反而艾希曼的恶显得非常平庸</translation>
                <original>むしろアイヒマンの悪っていうのが非常に陳腐</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="104">
                <start-time>00:07:11,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:15,100</end-time>
                <translation>只呈现出一个随处可见的普通人</translation>
                <original>どこにでもなんかいそうな人間</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="105">
                <start-time>00:07:15,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:18,925</end-time>
                <translation>所带有的样貌</translation>
                <original>が帯びているようなあの様相しか呈してない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="106">
                <start-time>00:07:18,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:21,525</end-time>
                <translation>VTR中出现的形象也是</translation>
                <original>Vtrの中で出てた姿も</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="107">
                <start-time>00:07:21,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:24,789</end-time>
                <translation>就是那种普通到不能再普通的普通人</translation>
                <original>もうそういうの言っちゃう冴えない普通の人ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="108">
                <start-time>00:07:24,789</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:26,640</end-time>
                <translation>-就是个戴眼镜的大叔啊 -是呢</translation>
                <original>-メガネのおじさんですよね　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="109">
                <start-time>00:07:27,990</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:30,775</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特是这样说的</translation>
                <original>でアーレントはこのようにいっています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="110">
                <start-time>00:07:30,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:32,898</end-time>
                <translation>不仅仅是遵守命令</translation>
                <original>命令に従っただけではなく</original>
                <spell/>
