            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="116">
                <start-time>00:07:49,915</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:52,884</end-time>
                <translation>那样的话多少还能让人理解</translation>
                <original>まあそれなりに納得いく話になるんですけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="117">
                <start-time>00:07:52,884</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:55,100</end-time>
                <translation>但他本人并不这么认为</translation>
                <original>本人は別にそう思ってなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="118">
                <start-time>00:07:55,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:57,700</end-time>
                <translation>而是认为这是法律所规定的</translation>
