            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="123">
                <start-time>00:08:09,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:13,425</end-time>
                <translation>一个懂得法治的人竟然会做出这种事</translation>
                <original>法の支配って分かる人がこういうことをやったのかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="124">
                <start-time>00:08:13,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:16,300</end-time>
                <translation>我想她首先对此感到困惑</translation>
                <original>たぶんそこでまず戸惑ったんじゃないかと思う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="125">
                <start-time>00:08:16,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:20,100</end-time>
                <translation>-接下来的内容让人相当在意啊　-是啊</translation>
                <original>-この先がちょっと相当気になってきましたね　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="126">
                <start-time>00:08:20,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:24,790</end-time>
                <translation>那么让我们来看看艾希曼实际做了怎样的证词吧</translation>
                <original>それではアイヒマンが実際にどのような証言を行ったのか見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="127">
                <start-time>00:08:27,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:30,730</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼在审讯中做了如下陈述</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは取り調べにおいてこう発言しています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="128">
                <start-time>00:08:32,470</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,425</end-time>
                <translation>我与杀害犹太人完全无关</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人殺害に私は全く関係しなかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="129">
                <start-time>00:08:37,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:41,950</end-time>
                <translation>我没有杀过任何一个犹太人或非犹太人</translation>
                <original>私はユダヤ人も非ユダヤ人も一人も殺していない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="130">
                <start-time>00:08:41,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:45,400</end-time>
                <translation>甚至我从来没有杀过人</translation>
                <original>そもそも人間を殺した事がない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="131">
                <start-time>00:08:45,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:51,600</end-time>
                <translation>我也从未下令杀害犹太人或非犹太人</translation>
                <original>ユダヤ人や非ユダヤ人の殺害を命じたこともない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="132">
                <start-time>00:08:51,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:55,125</end-time>
                <translation>他反复主张 犹太人被移送后是否会被杀害</translation>
                <original>彼は移送後のユダヤ人が殺されるかどうかは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="133">
                <start-time>00:08:55,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:58,220</end-time>
                <translation>不在自己的管辖范围内
自分の管轄外だと繰り返し主張します</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="134">
                <start-time>00:08:59,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:01,800</end-time>
                <translation>那不在我的管辖范围内</translation>
                <original>それは私の管轄外です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="135">
                <start-time>00:09:01,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:07,900</end-time>
                <translation>我不知道被移送的对象是否属于灭绝对象</translation>
                <original>移送される対象は絶滅対象か否かは分かりません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="136">
                <start-time>00:09:08,710</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,325</end-time>
                <translation>然后 他使用了大量资料</translation>
                <original>そして膨大な資料を使い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="137">
                <start-time>00:09:11,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:14,775</end-time>
                <translation>热心地证明自己是多么经验丰富的移送实务专家
自分がいかに経験豊かな移送の実務家で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="138">
                <start-time>00:09:14,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:20,400</end-time>
                <translation>以及如何将混乱的技术性问题顺利处理的</translation>
