            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="140">
                <start-time>00:09:27,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,050</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼也声称自己没有被任何人注意到</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは誰にも気に留められず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="141">
                <start-time>00:09:30,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:34,180</end-time>
                <translation>只是坐在桌子的一端</translation>
                <original>ただテーブルの端に座っていただけだと主張します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="142">
                <start-time>00:09:36,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:37,400</end-time>
