            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="146">
                <start-time>00:09:50,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:53,450</end-time>
                <translation>这种彻底忠诚的态度 （略）</translation>
                <original>徹底的に忠実だったこの態度こそが、（略）</original>
