                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="148">
                <start-time>00:09:56,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:58,775</end-time>
                <translation>毫无例外
例外なし</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="149">
                <start-time>00:09:58,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:05,050</end-time>
                <translation>这正是他无论出于情感还是基于利益</translation>
                <original>これこそ彼が感情的なものであれ利害に基づくものである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="150">
                <start-time>00:10:05,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,950</end-time>
                <translation>违背自身倾向而行动的</translation>
                <original>自分自身の傾向に逆らって行動したことの</original>
