            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="151">
                <start-time>00:10:08,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:14,515</end-time>
                <translation>始终履行自己＜义务＞的证明</translation>
                <original>常に自分の＜義務＞を果たしたことの証拠だった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="152">
                <start-time>00:10:15,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:18,075</end-time>
                <translation>艾希曼被法官问道</translation>
                <original>アイヒマンは裁判官に</original>
