            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="153">
                <start-time>00:10:18,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:22,525</end-time>
                <translation>他的义务感与良心之间是否没有冲突</translation>
                <original>義務感と良心の間に葛藤はなかったのかと尋ねられ</original>
