            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="353">
                <start-time>00:22:49,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,160</end-time>
                <translation>做演艺活动时也有啊 对于针对自己的意见</translation>
                <original>何か芸能活動をやってても自分に対する意見の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="354">
                <start-time>00:22:52,190</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,125</end-time>
                <translation>那些不甘心但确实有道理的否定 不是常有吗</translation>
                <original>悔しいけど一理あるっていう否定ってあるじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="355">
                <start-time>00:22:55,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:59,150</end-time>
                <translation>我也觉得那种必须接受</translation>
                <original>あれは受け止めなきゃいけないなって思うし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="356">
                <start-time>00:22:59,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:02,560</end-time>
                <translation>那时最难受 但也的确最能让人成长</translation>
                <original>一番きついけどそれが一番成長する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="357">
                <start-time>00:23:02,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,930</end-time>
                <translation>这是我的想法呢</translation>
                <original>って思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="358">
                <start-time>00:23:03,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,350</end-time>
                <translation>在这四晚的节目中阿伦特呢</translation>
                <original>今回の四夜でアーレントって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="359">
                <start-time>00:23:06,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,775</end-time>
                <translation>在某种意义上 她确实把对自己不利的事情都翻出来写</translation>
                <original>ある意味自分に都合の悪いことをちゃんとさらって書くよなって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="360">
                <start-time>00:23:10,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,550</end-time>
                <translation>感觉她彻底地、毫不逃避地做了记录</translation>
                <original>なんか徹底的に逃げずに記録した気がちょっとするんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="361">
                <start-time>00:23:15,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:18,342</end-time>
                <translation>阿伦特从未逃避到那种简单的解决方案</translation>
                <original>アーレントはそういうわかりやすい解決策とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="362">
                <start-time>00:23:18,342</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:21,300</end-time>
                <translation>或漂亮的解决方案中去</translation>
                <original>キレイには解決策に決して逃げなかったですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="363">
                <start-time>00:23:21,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:24,200</end-time>
                <translation>即便讨厌 也要忍受这种复数性</translation>
                <original>いやでもこの複数性に耐えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="364">
                <start-time>00:23:24,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,000</end-time>
                <translation>复数性 毕竟那个真正的情况</translation>
                <original>複数性やっぱりあの本当のところを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="365">
                <start-time>00:23:27,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:30,050</end-time>
                <translation>是相当痛苦的 只有忍受了它</translation>
                <original>あの結構きついですからそれに耐えて始めて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="366">
                <start-time>00:23:30,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,500</end-time>
                <translation>才能在某种程度上保持人性</translation>
                <original>あの人間らしさをまあある程度保つことができるんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="367">
                <start-time>00:23:34,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:37,060</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得她一直坚持着这样的想法</translation>
                <original>そういう考え方はずっとし続けてんだと思う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="368">
                <start-time>00:23:39,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,766</end-time>
                <translation>仲正老师 这四回真的非常感谢</translation>
                <original>仲正さん4回にわたり本当にありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="369">
                <start-time>00:23:42,766</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:43,580</end-time>
                <translation>（齐声）谢谢</translation>
                <original>（一斉に）ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
        </part>
    </body>
</ysj>
